# Per-task agent context/result files (SF-715): RepositoryCache already excludes .factory/ via the cache's
# info/exclude for every orchestrator-managed worktree, but that has no effect on a path already tracked in
# history (ignore rules never hide modifications to a tracked file) and does nothing for a plain manual clone.
# .factory/config.json is real repository configuration and stays tracked; only the per-run scratch files are
# ignored here.
.factory/result.json
.factory/task.md
